==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Grand Emperor Warumongar]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*6 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*5 [[Duche]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Rain D.]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Save up for [[Giga-Nyan Rex (Uber Rare Cat)|Giga-Nyan Prime DX]] and protect it with [[Helmet Cat (Special Cat)|Yellow Nyanko Rangers]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]]. The mecha will make quick work of the Duches and Rain D., and once they're out of the way, you can spam [[Scarf Cat (Special Cat)|Red Nyanko Rangers]] to finish off Grand Emperor Warumongar.

